    {
      "Name": "GPUBlockBoost",
      "Path": "/sys/kernel/ged/hal/gpu_boost_level",
      "Values": [
        "100",
        "70",
        "50",
        "30",
        "25",
        "20",
        "0",
        "-1"
      ],
      "ResetOnInit": true,
      "DefaultIndex": 6,
      "Comments": [
        "Mali-G720 MC7 - gpu_boost_level is a ONE-SHOT pulse, not a sustained floor",
        "Writing a value triggers a single boost pulse then GED returns to free DVFS",
        "0=default (no pulse), use targeted values per hint for burst moments",
        "[0] 100 = max burst (camera shot, extreme)",
        "[1]  70 = strong burst (expensive rendering, interaction)",
        "[2]  50 = medium burst (blur/blur rendering)",
        "[3]  30 = light pre-warm (touch down, launch pre-warm)",
        "[4]  25 = minimal pre-warm",
        "[5]  20 = game sustained low-overhead hint",
        "[6]   0 = off (default - let GED DVFS free-run)"
      ]
    },
    {
